  "text": "As of now, the program has covered 14,000 individuals and 2,000 social welfare recipient households, with over 1,000 beneficiaries receiving payouts after excessive rainfall in 2022–2023. In 2023, 1,013 farmers were paid FJD 201,000, with payouts delivered within two weeks. The next target is to cover 5,000 households and 200 MSMEs in the scaling phase.",
